{"id":"Wf153d57f03c8149636345871","zh":"扣件","en":"","name":"扣件","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wf153d57f03c8149636345871","text":"扣件","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S233477d0d2146674a436","source_id":"P136","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"弹性支承块式无砟轨道可以通过扣件和支承块下垫板实现快速调高。","citations":[{"source_id":"P136","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S569baa20b0a51fa8d346","source_id":"P136","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"当沉降波长为20 m 时, 沉降幅值小于10 mm 时,通过扣件调高即可恢复轨面高低平顺;当沉降幅值在10~20 mm 时,通过调整沉降中心左右支承块下垫板与调高扣件可恢复线路高低平顺;当沉降幅值超过20 mm 时, 仅对扣件和道床板进行调高已无法满足线路平顺性要求,需对轨下结构进行修补 [22]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P136","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P136":{"id":"P136","title":"基础变形对弹性支承块式无砟轨道变形及离缝影响研究","authors":"曾志平,吴霁崟,王卫东,王继军,徐磊,李桩,刘卓","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20240581","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"曾志平等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-study-on-the-deformation-and-the-gap-of-low-vibration-track-under-the-influence-of-foundation-deform"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"连接并支承钢轨的部件，模型中简化为三向弹簧。","language":"zh","source_id":"P136","paper_slug":"2025-study-on-the-deformation-and-the-gap-of-low-vibration-track-under-the-influence-of-foundation-deform","title":"基础变形对弹性支承块式无砟轨道变形及离缝影响研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W289ccfa8a7c2f5985e560840","name":"Fastener","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W289ccfa8a7c2f5985e560840","name":"Fastener","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W289ccfa8a7c2f5985e560840","name":"